{"id":"619072","name":"土豆焖饭","author":"明天妮好","authorId":"10450816","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619072/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"一个"},{"name":"茭瓜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆切块备用。","img":"images/619072/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茭瓜切小块，蒜切碎。","img":"images/619072/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"米淘好，浸泡。","img":"images/619072/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油微热，下蒜碎。","img":"images/619072/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜炒香，加土豆块，翻炒。","img":"images/619072/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入茭瓜。","img":"images/619072/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"酱油。","img":"images/619072/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒。","img":"images/619072/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将米捞出，加入锅内。","img":"images/619072/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"添水没过。","img":"images/619072/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分钟左右翻炒一下（炒锅。。。翻动不易糊）。","img":"images/619072/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"可以使用电饭煲，煮饭功能，就可以出干饭了。","img":"images/619072/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}